@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<section class="home">
    <p class="eyebrow">Moser.RagAi</p>
    <h1>Intranet policy RAG</h1>
    <p>
        At startup, policy files are split, embedded, and stored in this Web process.
        A question finds similar slices; the model answers from those slices; Policy can still Deny.
    </p>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Ingest</strong> — read <code>data/seed/policy</code>, chunk, embed, index.</li>
        <li><strong>Retrieve</strong> — embed the question and pull the nearest chunks.</li>
        <li><strong>Generate</strong> — the model writes from those chunks; C# Policy can Deny or send to a human.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
        <a href="/assistant/ask">Ask</a>
        · <a href="/assistant/status">Index status</a>
        · <a href="/legend">Legend</a>
        · <a href="/rag-pipeline.html">Animated flow (ingest → index → retrieve → generate → policy)</a>
    </p>
</section>
